==============================================================================
N5 -- is throughput the same thing as charge?
==============================================================================
The N1 identity w Q = 2(E_kin + E_g) is what defines w_bar here, so
T/(w_bar Q) = 1 - 2 E_em/(w_bar Q) is a CONSISTENCY check, not a test:
its deviation from 1 measures the gauge share of the throughput.
The physical N5 content is the gauge share and the EXCESS eps_bar:

