  This is the in-kernel counterpart of the shooter's eps = 0.9-4.3%%.
  gauge shift w_core/w_bar - 1: -0.0435 .. -0.0019 -- the ball-centre clock
  runs FASTER/SLOWER than the throughput-derived bare omega by this
  amount. A nonzero, g-dependent shift is the direct signature that
  CHARGE, ACTION and the LOCAL CLOCK are three different things
  (GROUNDING §0's three-way split), measured rather than argued.

